<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Engungwel Tite</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool ola Tite</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tite</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tit</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool ola</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tite</para>
  <para style="imt">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wu, Pool ayuɔɔl ndɛ ola Tite wu mbiri Ebvɔɔn. Ndɛ wu Tite oli ɔ̃nkiool wɛn k'Ɔ̃yuda (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 2:1-3">Nga 2.1-3</ref></char>). Ndɛ hɛ̃ oli ndoo a Pool onse ɔ̃sal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 7:6-16">2Ko 7.6-16</ref></char>). Me nkuul a ndɛ wu Tite, ɔ̃nkaan oli wu Ebvɔɔn lueel li bviil li Kelete, bvel-bvel me ndɔɔ yi etal emfa ki edzu lɔ me nkuul Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal.</para>
  <para style="ip">Onse ɔ̃nkaan wu, ke mbee ɔ̃bio (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 1:1-4">1.1-4</ref></char>), Pool ayɛɛn m'ãndɔɔ ãtyel. Ndɛ apio ɔ̃liɛɛn onse ndɔɔ yi ãtyel. Ndɔɔ yi ɛ̃kwel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 1:5-16">1.5-16</ref></char>) etal osuaal b'akuu-kuul y'ambiri b'Ebvɔɔn. Onkyam ŋɛn ebvaan bɔ akal y'emfa mwiĩ ki ngesɛ, bɔ hɛ̃ ebvaan adzwaan y'ãtee m'ãdzeel baal. Ndɔɔ yi mbuaal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 2:1-15">2.1-15</ref></char>) etal ãtee mã taa-taa mã baal b'amaayal, y'emfa ki ekal ãnsam, y'ankyal. Tite ebvaan ayeel baal bueel nyiĩ a Nziã yi émɔɔ̃n me nkuul a Yeso Mãsia. Ndɔɔ yi ãtyel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 3:1-11">3.1-11</ref></char>) yi etal emfa ki asam onse Ebvɔɔn me nkuul Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal. Pool osɛɛl ɔ̃nkaan a ndɛ m'owa b'ãnkunkwa bibi bvool m'ɔ̃bio wu ntɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 3:12-15">3.12-15</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool, mɛ̃ ndi ɔ̃sal a Nziã, bvool ndi ntam a Yeso Mãsia me ndɔɔ yi ebiri baal b'ésueel ndɛ wu Nziã k'okiool, bvool esuul bɔ ayɛɛ otaa-taa b'obiri baal k'akuru nzuru me ndɛ. <verse eid="TIT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2" />M'emfa okyɛ, bɔ akal ye kaã li elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. Elaã olɔ, Nziã wɛn k'apfuru wɛ, ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ye k'ebɛɛn ɔ̃kiri, álieel ndiri ndɛ àwa bia-byɛ lɔ. <verse eid="TIT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />Ŋ'ékoo lio li éwɛɛ Nziã wu Ɔ̃mvuul a bia-byɛ, ndɛ áyɛɛl Endɔɔ e ndɛ onse ãtee m'éwi ndɛ mɛ̃, m'emfa ki ontam o ndɛ. <verse eid="TIT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />Mɛ̃ ngyuɔɔl ɔ̃nkaan wu ola yɛ wu Tite wu muaan a mɛ̃ wa taa-taa onse okiool b'obvool bia-byɛ. Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ ye Mfam Yeso Mãsia wu Ɔ̃mvuul bia-byɛ asio yɛ nyiĩ bvool awa yɛ opi!<verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Epfuũ bvi ata m'osuaal b'ɔ̃kuul a Ebvɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />M'ésiil yɛ k'esanga ki Kelete kwɛn oŋɔ̃ yɛ faal ãndɔɔ m'ãsiil. Me bviil bwɛn a bviil, suaal akuul-kuul b'ebvɔɔn, m'emfa ki étam mɛ̃ yɛ osa. <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" />Ɔ̃kuul a ebvɔɔn ebvaan akal mbuul wɛn elyal pyɛ, akal ɔ̃lam wu ɔ̃kal kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃. Baan a ndɛ ebvaan akal akiool. K'ebvaan bɔ akal baan b'abetuaal ndiri bɔ ali y'epfuũ bvi ebi-ebi bvool aywɛn a lweel wɛ. <verse eid="TIT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ɔ̃kuul a ebvɔɔn ebvaan akal elyal pyɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ wu atal ãndɔɔ ã Nziã. Ndɛ ebvaan akal ondɛɛl o nzuru pyɛ, ebvaan ndɛ akal mpuru pyɛ, k'ebvaan ndɛ akal ɔnywã-mbal wɛ, k'ebvaan ndɛ akal mbuul wa ye kɔɔ-kɔɔ wɛ, k'ebvaan hɛ̃ ndɛ akal mbuul wu abii nzi m'ãnkuul m'ãbi-ãbi wɛ. <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />Kɛn a ndɛ ebvaan ayɛɛ k'ayɔɔ baal ngesɛ, mbuul wu odzii ãndɔɔ mã ngesɛ, wu oli y'ombuul, wa dzu, wa ngel bvool wu oli y'okuru b'ɔ̃kwal. <verse eid="TIT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />Ebvaan ndɛ akuru nzuru m'Endɔɔ li taa-taa m'emfa ki átee ndɛ lɔ. Obobɔ, ndɛ okoo k'awɛɛl bakyɛ m'ãtee mã taa-taa, bvool okoo k'akuru ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃ b'ali onse otaal ye ndɛ.<verse eid="TIT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Me ndɔɔ a atee ba mfya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, eli ye baal bibi b'aywɛn a lweel, bɔ ali ye ndiaal yi ngwel-a-ngwel bvool ali emfuru-baal, bvel-bvel onse baal bɛn átsiil bɔ. <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />Ebvaan yɛ akuru bɔ ɛ̃nywã. Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ abetsal ãyam ã baal bibi m'oyiool b'ãndɔɔ mɛn k'ebvaan ayiool wɛ, me ndɔɔ yi abii furu li ebi-ebi. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Ngɔmɔ̃ onse bam, wu oli ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a álieel ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="TIT 1:12">«Baal a Kelete ali kɛn a anga-mfya, anyam b'abi, anga-ɔ̃tam, anga-obwal b'abetsam kɛn ɔ̃la a bam.»<verse eid="TIT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Ãndɔɔ m'éyɛɛn ndɛ omɔ̃ ãli taa-taa. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, pɛɛn bɔ bam kɔkɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ akal y'okiool bo taa-taa. <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />Abee nzuru okuru m'esesam bvi Ayuda y'ãngel ã baal b'abee otaa-taa. <verse eid="TIT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Eluɔ bvieel eli tsɛtsɛ me ndɔɔ a baal bueel ba tsɛtsɛ. Kɛn eluɔ si emɔ̃ ki tsɛtsɛ pyɛ me baal bɛn k'ali tsɛtsɛ wɛ bvool aywɛn okiool. Ãyal y'ãtsam mi ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ ãli ye mbiin. <verse eid="TIT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />Bɔ abeyɛɛn ndiri bɔ ayɛɛ Nziã, kɛn ãndɔɔ m'ebesa bɔ ãsuo kwɛn bɔ k'ayɛɛ ndɛ wɛ. Bɔ k'alweel ndɛ wɛ. Bɔ baal b'anduru obi, bvool k'akoo k'asa ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ yi mvɛ wɛ.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ãtee m'ãbvaan m'ɔ̃kiool bwɛn a ɔ̃kiool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Me b'ota yɛ, yiool ãndɔɔ m'ãbvaan m'ãtee mã dzu. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />Tee ekukwel wɛn akal baal bɛn k'asa ãndɔɔ y'enduul wɛ, akal baal a dzuun, akal baal ba y'ombuul, akal baal b'amaasɛn anã onse okiool, onse dzii bvool onse osɛ-mwiĩ. <verse eid="TIT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃, tee akaal b'amaayal wɛn akal y'epfuũ bvi ebvaan me baal ba ngel. Bɔ abee baal obekwe, abee hɛ̃ ankyal a mbal okal, kɛn a bɔ ayiool baal ãndɔɔ mã ngesɛ. <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />M'emfa okyɛ bɔ ayiool ãnsam m'akaal k'adzii alam ye baan a bɔ. <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />Yiool bɔ hɛ̃ k'akal y'ombuul, k'akal tsɛtsɛ, k'asa ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ nzɔ, k'akal akaal ba ngesɛ, k'akal ye lweel li alam, kwɛn baal abee Endɔɔ e Nziã opfiɔɔl.<verse eid="TIT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃, wa ãnsam m'abɔɔl luo k'akal y'ombuul. <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />M'ãndɔɔ mbueel, yam suo ɛ̃sal mi ngesɛ, kwɛn bɔ aluɛɛn kuul e yɛ. Yɔɔl kwɛn ãtee ã yɛ ãkal mã dzu bvool m'elweel baal. <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />Yɛɛn ãndɔɔ mã ngesɛ mɛn baal k'akoo k'ayɛɛn obi me mɔ̃ wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn b'ali onse otaal ye bia-byɛ ayoo opfuru, abee si ndɔɔ ngamɔ̃ yi mbi yi ayɛɛn me bia-byɛ obɔɔ.<verse eid="TIT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />Tee ankyal wɛn alweel amfam a bɔ m'ãndɔɔ mbueel, asa mpɛn yi asa bɔ esɛ, abee onse otaal ye bɔ okal. <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />Tee bɔ hɛ̃ wɛn abee eluɔ bvi amfa a bɔ oturu, kɛn a bɔ akal baal b'akuru ãnzuru mam mbueel m'amfam a bɔ, m'emfa okyɛ, bɔ b'ankyal akal baal b'alweel ãtee ã Nziã wu Ɔ̃mvuul a bia-byɛ m'ãndɔɔ mbueel.<verse eid="TIT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyiĩ a Nziã émeemɔɔn ola baal bueel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Ke ngwel wɛ, nyiĩ a Nziã yi ebvuul baal, émeemɔɔn ola baal bueel. <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />Nyiĩ oyɔ yi eyiool bia-byɛ k'ebee ãndɔɔ ã Nziã opfiɔɔl, k'ebee esɛ bvi ɔ̃kiri wu, bvool k'ekal y'ombuul bueel me lio li, k'ekal dzu bvool k'ekuru nzuru me Nziã. <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />Okyɛ emfa ki ekiaal bia-byɛ obvɛ b'ebeta bia-byɛ kaã. Tsoo olɔ li ekieel emɔɔn lweel e Yeso-Mãsia wu Nziã a bia-byɛ wu Ɔ̃nɛn bvool wu Ɔ̃mvuul a bia-byɛ. <verse eid="TIT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" />Ndɛ áwi elaã e ndɛ me ndyam me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ ndɛ asuun bia-byɛ m'obi bueel bvool asuul bia-byɛ tsɛtsɛ me ndɔɔ yi ekal baal a ndyam, baal b'adzii bam k'asa ãndɔɔ mã ngesɛ. <verse eid="TIT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />Omɔ̃ ãndɔɔ mɛn ebvaan yɛ atee y'okwɛn bueel, me ndɔɔ yi awɛɛl baal wuo me ndɔɔ yi awa bɔ hɛ̃ mbyel. Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul si ɔ̃mɔ̃ abee yɛ opfiɔɔl!<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Elaã li enyiɔɔn li akiool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />Yeel baal bueel akal ye lweel li ambiri y'amfam, alweel bɔ bvool akal y'ɔyɛɛl wu asa ãndɔɔ mbueel mã ngesɛ. <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" />Liaal bɔ abee mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ otoo, akal onse opi ye baal, akal baal b'abebvool baal, b'aluul m'efyɛ onse baal bueel. <verse eid="TIT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bia-byɛ tsɔɔn éli ewool, baal b'aywɛn a lweel, baal b'ádziɔɔn, ankyal b'efua y'esɛ bvi emfa bwɛn a emfa. Bia-byɛ ékesa ãndɔɔ m'ãbi-ãbi, éli y'ɔ̃kwal-nsɔɔ, ékebyal baal bvool ékebyal bakyɛ onse bia-byam. <verse eid="TIT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />Kɛn a ŋ'esuo Nziã wu Ɔ̃mvuul a bia-byɛ obvɛ o ndɛ ye dzii e ndɛ me ndɔɔ a baal, <verse eid="TIT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />ndɛ obvuul bia-byɛ. K'eli me ndɔɔ yɛn bia-byɛ ési ɛ̃sal mi dzu wɛ, eli kɛn a me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ ásio bia-byɛ nyiĩ. Ndɛ ábvuul bia-byɛ ŋ'ésuɔɔl ndɛ bia-byɛ m'oburu bo mburu yuaal bvool me nkuul Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal wu owi bia-byɛ elaã li enyiɔɔn. <verse eid="TIT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />Ɔ̃fel ondɛ, Nziã áyiri ndɛ ngamfɛn nkal a bia-byɛ me nkuul Ɔ̃mvuul a bia-byɛ Yeso-Mãsia. <verse eid="TIT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />Ndɛ ási obobɔ me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ ámaasuul bia-byɛ dzu me nyiĩ a ndɛ, kwɛn bia-byɛ èbɔɔ bvel li elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu li ebeta bia-byɛ kaã. <verse eid="TIT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Oyɔ ndɔɔ yi ebvaan m'okiool, bvool mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn yɛ yiool yɔ y'ɔ̃tɛɛ̃ wueel, me ndɔɔ yɛn b'akiool Nziã awa ɔ̃tsiin a bɔ wueel m'osa b'ɛ̃sal mi ngesɛ. Oyɔ ndɔɔ yi ngesɛ bvool yi ɔ̃bvɛn me ndɔɔ a baal bueel. <verse eid="TIT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />Kɛn a yɔɔl esesam bvi owool-a-wool, otaal b'ɛ̃luo mi ãnkuun m'ankɔɔ, obel y'ɛ̃tsuun me ndɔɔ a Ngel. Ke ngwel wɛ, omɔ̃ mam mbueel ãndɔɔ mã ngwel-a-ngwel bvool mɛn otsɛn pyɛ. <verse eid="TIT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Mbuul wu akab baal, sial ndɛ lala ye yɛ, ke mbee a ŋ'ewi yɛ ndɛ ãnkunkwa sa li ɛ̃kwel ye li yuaal. <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />Yɛɛ kwɛn mbuul wu obobɔ àmaadzɛɛn nkuul bvool abesa obi, ndɛ ŋ'abewa nzuru a ndyam etumbu.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luo y'ɔ̃bio wu a ntɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />Kieel ŋ'èyuɔɔl me Ahatemas wuo Tiswik ola yɛ, sa mpɛn kwɛn yɛ yebɔɔ mɛ̃ ke Nikopolis, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ nkuru kwɛn ɔ̃bvu wa mfyɛ abwel mɛ̃ oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" />Yɛɛ k'awuaal a Dzenas wu ɔ̃yiool-ãngel y'Apolos, kwɛn bɔ abee eluɔ oywɛn me ndɔɔ a dzwɛ e bɔ. <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />Ebvaan kwɛn baal a bia-byɛ hɛ̃ ayio k'asa ɛ̃sal mi ngesɛ, me ndɔɔ yi awuaal a baal b'ali y'ãkɔɔ m'asoo tswa-a-tswa, kwɛn bɔ abee nsia oywɛn. <verse eid="TIT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Bam bueel b'ali ye mɛ̃ abio yɛ. Bio andoo b'adzii bia-byɛ onse okiool.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:15">Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã asio byɛ bueel nyiĩ!<verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>